cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ModelaDB, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ModelaDB"
type: software
version: 2.3.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/williancomp/modeladb-ufmt-app"
abstract: >-
  ModelaDB is a browser-based editor for Chen-style and Crow's Foot ER/EER diagrams with rule-based
  validation and code generation for SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MariaDB, SQLite), Laravel, Prisma, Django,
  GraphQL and JSON Schema.
keywords:
  - entity-relationship model
  - conceptual modelling
  - EER
  - database design
authors:
